  m_text: 'Ak 47, was designed in 1949 by Mikhail Kalasnikow. By order of the armed
    forces of the Soviet Union. The most produced rifle ever, was made more then
    100.000.000 copies. The assault rifle uses 7.62mm cartridges. The Soviet Union
    no longer exists, but it is still used by 106 countries...

'
